{"title":"Peak Ages of Productivity for Authors, Painters, Musicians & Scientists","link":"https://informationisbeautiful.net/2025/peak-ages-of-productivity-for-authors-painters-musicians-scientists/","date":1751636504000,"content":"<p><strong>Using number of books, paintings, albums and papers released by practitioners at each age.</strong></p>\n<p>Interesting research from <a href=\"https://www.degruyterbrill.com/document/doi/10.1515/9781474467889-007/pdf?licenseType=restricted\">Miller (1999)</a> and <a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S009265660200538X\">Kanazawa (2003)</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/4015344f7a1d4d64e4f071d104866852e4711adbbaca9142cf91f0b43b1a0e96.png\" width=\"800\" alt=\"Alt text: &quot;Graph showing number of books released by male and female authors at different ages. Peak production age for both genders is around 46. Data source: Miller (1999) from a sample of 229 notable authors.&quot;\" height=\"2160\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/a96712593bffe6e98e5f1d6347e28accbf68e96a22527404c753bf026f362e4e.png\" width=\"800\" alt=\"Area Graph titled &quot;Painters - Peak Age of Production&quot; showing the number of paintings created by artists at different ages from a sample of 739 painters. The peak production age is 35, with separate lines for male (blue) and female (beige) painters. Data source: Miller (1999).\" height=\"2160\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/09e2cd0dad476355e29b9d06c2f8b68f7b0dcc3c2c7e97b4a72f06836ca80973.png\" width=\"800\" alt=\"Area Graph titled &quot;Jazz Musicians - Peak Age&quot; showing the number of albums released by artists of each age. The peak number of albums is at age 36. Data source: Miller (1999) from a sample of 719 notable jazz musicians.\" height=\"2160\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/357819faab3783e82cda4b01c29c5840e8e3195ecaa79013763d0837b3e17da1.png\" width=\"800\" alt=\"Area Graph showing peak age for scientists' major discoveries and publications. The x-axis represents age ranging from 20 to 80, and the y-axis shows the number of discoveries. The purple curve (1935-1965) peaks sharply around age 37, while the green curve (post-1965) peaks more broadly. Annotations indicate that the burden of knowledge increased after 1965, requiring more time to master fields.\" height=\"800\" srcset=\"/media/1aa85f94c9395b79d16acf1ba5913b284e0d8df7c834a86a3f1ad24e53076ddb.png 2161w, /media/e3b24ea54269c0c70fb6034c98642ce736d57c4b65cade5dd5858e1f0a802d06.png 480w, /media/07a4d841569ea1a20ae9bef5c48c47f35b439d826853b08d6b15f5a772eb8c12.png 960w, /media/5784c998ebcec95b748c4d82aa346ca320e37ed1263654d544d2ad28cc60e767.png 150w, /media/2e19cf4c135f89344fb17279faccfa227a83b2a112036bd075668ee2137af4cc.png 768w, /media/d6ad71c0946a66b088306e08a22df4cae996750897acc300cce01b8b42414b00.png 1600w, /media/673577947b0aab644f9e7aacadead8733566a8e5863b46958e20af15ccb62925.png 1200w, /media/18c5cb9f363d6a0be4780e3d1244448b8a71bd92db122352c8ab791c188302b2.png 240w, /media/4acf69470ba2f48d6faf64dd94696827d4223ec720b440d762300f4033e7e170.png 1536w, /media/5113a2646735c280c59767ec15756c5c690fd0744b78889fb7bb06fc695032a4.png 2048w\" /></p>","author":"David McCandless","siteTitle":"Information is Beautiful","siteHash":"0e7035277196509eff939ff4c03ce840d3aed5dc63eafcf609568a61850e5f9f","entryHash":"f0890fefd528384a09f628091fcd64dc1bcae798802c6d77cb93da61d9a721b7","category":"Tech"}